# Optional share-list config for `scripts/worktree.sh`
#
# Place at repo root as `worktree.share`.
# Whitespace / newline separated paths relative to the main tree.
# Comments (#) and blank lines ignored.
#
# If this file exists — even with zero items — defaults are NOT used.
# That lets pure libraries declare "nothing to share" on purpose.
#
# Examples:
#   .dev.vars
#   .wrangler
#   .env.local
